  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "¡Eh, tú! ¡<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȂElLa del Equipo MZ!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 588,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100450068002C0020007400FA0021002000A100100003110000FF02020045006C004C0061002000640065006C002000450071007500690070006F0020004D005A0021001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Digo yo que no te negarás a echar una mano\npara ayudar a gente en apuros, ¿eh?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Claro que no!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 836,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10043006C00610072006F00200071007500650020006E006F00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Supongo...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 868,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300750070006F006E0067006F002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Perfecto.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 892,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006500720066006500630074006F002E001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Es que resulta que he oído unos gritos que venían\nde esas alcantarillas.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quería ir a investigar de qué se trata, pero he oído\nque ahí abajo habitan Pokémon de tipo Fantasma<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ny que dan mucho miedo...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1076,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 132
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Y como don Córax se fía de ti, ¿te parece si me\nechas un cable y vas a investigar por mí?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Pero no es que tenga miedo, eh!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1528,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1005000650072006F0020006E006F0020006500730020007100750065002000740065006E006700610020006D006900650064006F002C0020006500680021001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tú eres tela de fuerte, así que ya sabes:\n¡A currar por el bien de la ciudad!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Toca investigar las alcantarillas. Venga, ve tú\nprimero.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054006F0063006100200069006E007600650073007400690067006100720020006C0061007300200061006C00630061006E0074006100720069006C006C00610073002E002000560065006E00670061002C0020007600650020007400FA000A007000720069006D00650072006F002E001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Y que conste que no tengo miedo! Pero es mejor\nque vaya delante el más fuerte.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1904,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pues no veo dónde está el problema...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2072,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00500075006500730020006E006F002000760065006F0020006400F3006E00640065002000650073007400E100200065006C002000700072006F0062006C0065006D0061002E002E002E001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Eh? Esos son...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2156,
