      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00500061007200650063006500200071007500650020006E006F00200068006100790020006E006100640069006500200065006E006300650072007200610064006F00200065006E00200065006C00200069006E0074006500720069006F0072000A006400650020006500730074006500200043006F00660061006700720069006700750073002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "El Cofagrigus se ha marchado...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 4976,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006C00200043006F006600610067007200690067007500730020007300650020006800610020006D006100720063006800610064006F002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Se le ha caído algo mientras escapaba!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 5040,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1005300650020006C006500200068006100200063006100ED0064006F00200061006C0067006F0020006D00690065006E007400720061007300200065007300630061007000610062006100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La presencia de Cofagrigus se percibe aún en\nlas alcantarillas.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 5120,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C0061002000700072006500730065006E00630069006100200064006500200043006F00660061006700720069006700750073002000730065002000700065007200630069006200650020006100FA006E00200065006E000A006C0061007300200061006C00630061006E0074006100720069006C006C00610073002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿6",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 5248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Mis ojos! ¡Hay demasiada luz!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 5260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004D006900730020006F006A006F00730021002000A1004800610079002000640065006D0061007300690061006400610020006C0075007A002100100002011401D60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Te encuentras bien?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 5332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0054006500200065006E006300750065006E00740072006100730020006200690065006E003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Qué ha pasado?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 5376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0051007500E9002000680061002000700061007300610064006F003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ay, qué vergüenza... En Ciudad Luminalia hay\nunos Pokémon bien extraños...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nResulta que me he emocionado muchísimo al\ntoparme con un Cofagrigus.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 58,
      "offsetInSection": 5408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 151
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Me he puesto tan eufórico que he empezado a\ngritar y seguramente lo he molestado.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 59,
      "offsetInSection": 5712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Y entonces se ha enfadado y me ha tragado.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 60,
      "offsetInSection": 5884,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005900200065006E0074006F006E00630065007300200073006500200068006100200065006E00660061006400610064006F002000790020006D00650020006800610020007400720061006700610064006F002E00100002011401D60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "El caso es que me encontraba tan a gusto en su\ninterior que he debido de quedarme dormido.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 61,
      "offsetInSection": 5980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pero bueno, ¡muchas gracias por rescatarme!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 62,
      "offsetInSection": 6172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005000650072006F0020006200750065006E006F002C002000A1006D007500630068006100730020006700720061006300690061007300200070006F0072002000720065007300630061007400610072006D0065002100100002011401D60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Puede que haya alguien en el interior de alguno\nde esos Cofagrigus, así que vamos a buscarlos.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 63,
      "offsetInSection": 6268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿@",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 64,
      "offsetInSection": 6468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00400000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Toma, ¡bien hecho!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 65,
      "offsetInSection": 6480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054006F006D0061002C002000A1006200690065006E00200068006500630068006F0021001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hemos salvado a la persona que pedía auxilio.\n¡Somos lo más!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 66,
      "offsetInSection": 6528,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00480065006D006F0073002000730061006C007600610064006F002000610020006C006100200070006500720073006F006E00610020007100750065002000700065006400ED006100200061007500780069006C0069006F002E000A00A10053006F006D006F00730020006C006F0020006D00E100730021001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿A que es un gustazo hacer algo por el bien de\nCiudad Luminalia?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 67,
      "offsetInSection": 6660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0041002000710075006500200065007300200075006E002000670075007300740061007A006F00200068006100630065007200200061006C0067006F00200070006F007200200065006C0020006200690065006E002000640065000A0043006900750064006100640020004C0075006D0069006E0061006C00690061003F001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tendrías que darme las gracias por haberte\navisado de lo que sucedía.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 68,
      "offsetInSection": 6800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540065006E0064007200ED0061007300200071007500650020006400610072006D00650020006C006100730020006700720061006300690061007300200070006F007200200068006100620065007200740065000A006100760069007300610064006F0020006400650020006C006F002000710075006500200073007500630065006400ED0061002E001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Detrás de ti...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 69,
      "offsetInSection": 6948,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004400650074007200E10073002000640065002000740069002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Se te va a tragar...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 70,
      "offsetInSection": 6980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00530065002000740065002000760061002000610020007400720061006700610072002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Qué?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 71,
      "offsetInSection": 7024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0051007500E9003F001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Uaaah!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 72,
      "offsetInSection": 7044,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1005500610061006100680021001000020114001D0000",
